This product bundles no third-party source. It depends at runtime on
PostgreSQL, Keycloak and WireMock, each obtained as an official container
image under its own licence, and on the Python packages listed in
requirements.txt.

The vendor names appearing in this project (ServiceNow, Splunk, Onspring,
Okta, Tenable, Workday and CrowdStrike) are trademarks of their respective
owners. VirtualOrg is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from any
of them. Its API twins are independent models written from published
behaviour. Every one is derived as "unverified" from twins/provenance.yaml,
which records the basis for each response shape and whether it was ever
captured, precisely so that no passing test is mistaken for vendor
certification.
